# {{.ProjectName}}

Multi-application project powered by [Yogan Framework](https://github.com/KOMKZ/go-yogan-framework).

## Project Structure

```
{{.ProjectName}}/
├── go.work              # Go workspace configuration
├── apps/                # Application modules
│   └── {{.AppName}}/    # First HTTP application
├── domains/             # Shared domain packages
├── proto/               # Shared protobuf definitions
{{- if .GenerateProto}}
│   └── payment/         # Demo payment service (example)
{{- end}}
├── pkg/                 # Shared utility packages
│   ├── errdef/          # Error definitions
│   └── apputil/         # Application utilities
└── scripts/             # Build and utility scripts
```

## Quick Start

```bash
# Build all applications
./scripts/build.sh

# Build specific application
./scripts/build.sh {{.AppName}}

# Run application
cd apps/{{.AppName}} && go run main.go
```

## Adding New Application

1. Create new app directory: `apps/new-app/`
2. Add to go.work: `use ./apps/new-app`
3. Follow the structure of existing apps

## Adding New Domain

1. Create domain directory: `domains/user/`
2. Add go.mod: `module {{.ProjectModule}}/domains/user`
3. Add to go.work: `use ./domains/user`
{{if .GenerateProto}}
## Proto / gRPC

### 依赖安装

```bash
# 安装 protoc 编译器
brew install protobuf

# 安装 Go 插件
go install google.golang.org/protobuf/cmd/protoc-gen-go@latest
go install google.golang.org/grpc/cmd/protoc-gen-go-grpc@latest

# 确保插件在 PATH 中
export PATH="$PATH:$(go env GOPATH)/bin"
```

### 生成代码

```bash
cd proto/payment
make gen
```

详见 `proto/payment/README.md`。
{{end}}
## Configuration

Each application has its own config in `apps/<app>/config/config.yaml`.

